            "question": "Evaluate lim(x→3) (x² - 9)/(x - 3).",
            "elo": 500,
            "answers":[
              "3",
              "5",
              "2",
              "6"
            ],
            "correctAnswer": "B",
            "explanation": "Factor x² - 9 = (x - 3)(x + 3). Cancel x - 3, then substitute x = 3 to get 6."
          },
          {
            "question": "Evaluate lim(x→0) (sin x)/x, where x is measured in radians.",
