            "answers":[
              "3",
              "5",
              "2",
              "6"
            ],
            "correctAnswer": "B",
            "explanation": "This is a standard trigonometric limit: lim(x→0) sin(x)/x = 1."
          },
          {
            "question": "Evaluate lim(x→2) (x² - 4)/(x - 2).",
            "elo": 1300,
            "answers":[
              "3",
              "5",
              "2",
              "6"
            ],
            "correctAnswer": "B",
            "explanation": "Factor x² - 4 = (x - 2)(x + 2). Cancel x - 2 and substitute x = 2 to obtain 4."
          },
          {
            "question": "Evaluate lim(x→0) (√(x + 4) - 2)/x.",
            "elo": 1800,
            "answers":[
              "3",
              "5",
              "2",
              "6"
            ],
            "correctAnswer": "B",
            "explanation": "Multiply the numerator and denominator by √(x + 4) + 2. The expression becomes 1/(√(x + 4) + 2). Substituting x = 0 gives 1/4."
          }
